  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu vuông góc của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> trên đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đối xứng với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> qua <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>55</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math><br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>′</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>136</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>136</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>△</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (bất đẳng thức tam giác).<br>Dấu bẳng xảy ra khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> thẳng hàng.<br>Vậy tổng độ dài đường ống từ trạm nước <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> đến <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> nhỏ nhất là bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/925dae754a851fbb3dc61877c275fdbb470bc8c1f85d1a63abda9bac3b1052ed.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
